{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1288.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"ffadc147f28991d2e54bbbee370eefe34ebf6e870fd13caca7c9cfac98d8758a","ja":"うーん……これは私が代わりに\n入った方がいいかしら……？","zh":"唔……这种情况是不是由我来\n顶替上去比较好呢……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
